# Canonicalization

NixOS with preservation and a git repository in HOME with nix-flakes numtide/blueprint git submodules in go-style paths.

# Initialize HOME
# Create the empty project remote
git_canonicalization init home
# Add required home whitelist entries
# Stage their files before cleanup.

# Initialize repository
git_canonicalization init flake git@github.com:owner/demo.git

# Initialize package
cd "$HOME/github.com/owner/demo"
git_canonicalization add python demo "A demo package."

# Format, build/test packages/hosts
nix fmt
nix flake check
